      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787469626884,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2 types of changes to cater:\n1. Remote changes:\nthe clients subscribe to remote changes, whenever there is a remote change, the sync svc returns the bloburls of the changes files\nand the client downloads it\n\n2. Local changes\nWin/os notifies the client for the file changes, then client calls\n",
      "fontSize": 19.798297034230778,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2 types of changes to cater:\n1. Remote changes:\nthe clients subscribe to remote changes, whenever there is a remote change, the sync svc returns the bloburls of the changes files\nand the client downloads it\n\n2. Local changes\nWin/os notifies the client for the file changes, then client calls\n",
